1. Purpose

crm-dashboard-01 is a frontend-only CRM dashboard V1 designed as a polished portfolio/demo product interface.

The project focuses on realistic CRM workflows and dashboard presentation without requiring a backend, database, real authentication, payments, or external APIs.

The V1 is considered frozen after the final lint and production build checks pass.

