6. Styling Standard

The project was converted from CSS to SCSS.

Examples:

import styles from './Topbar.module.scss'

import './index.scss'

The project should not introduce random .css files after freeze.

Sass @use is preferred for new shared SCSS imports instead of deprecated @import rules.

