16. Charts

Bar chart

BarChart.jsx renders an SVG chart from:

[{ label, value }]

It supports hover interaction and a formatted tooltip.

The chart uses a controlled pixel height so the chart remains visually proportional inside the dashboard card.

Donut chart

DonutChart.jsx renders SVG stroke-dasharray segments and supports hover interaction between chart segments and legend items.

