18. Icon System

The project currently retains its CRM Icon component because several dashboard components use it.

Before removing or replacing it, first check all references:

grep -RIn "Icon" src --include="*.jsx" --include="*.js"

Do not blindly delete the icon system from this project while existing components still depend on it.

