23. V1 Freeze Criteria

The project is considered frozen when:

npm run lint passes with 0 warnings and 0 errors.

npm run build completes successfully.

Dashboard visual layout is approved.

Chart sizing is approved.

Sign In works as a frontend demo.

Profile, Settings, and Logout modals work.

Logged-in and logged-out UI states work.

Mobile navigation works.

No unintended .css imports remain.

No known blocker remains in the current V1 scope.

Once frozen, do not redesign the project while moving to the next portfolio project unless a real blocker is discovered.

